- verify each item against current code before acting
- Validators must NOT read this
- backlog notes are not guaranteed current truth

Example tracking:

- LayerStackSection:
  - CSS class mismatch (`layer-stack__index` vs `layer-stack__card-index`)

- GridCardsSection:
  - `signal-board` requires badge/status but not enforced in code

- GridCardsSection:
  - `.grid-cards--signal-board .grid-card[data-status='risk']` does not match JSX class `grid-cards__item`, and no `data-status` is emitted

